{"id":"661503","name":"红糖酥饼","author":"伊悠悠","authorId":"230225","desc":"","cover":"images/661503/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"开水","amount":"180g"}],"sub":[{"name":"红糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"先做油酥：面粉里加入烧热的油，搅拌匀。","img":"images/661503/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"克面粉加刚烧的开水180克，搅拌絮状，待温凉后，揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/661503/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"擀成长方形。","img":"images/661503/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"刷油酥。","img":"images/661503/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"卷起，","img":"images/661503/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"均匀切块。","img":"images/661503/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"与其中一个面团，用擀面杖擀大，放入红糖馅（红糖适量加一勺面粉搅拌匀）。","img":"images/661503/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"像包包子一样，包起来。","img":"images/661503/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"擀成牛舌状。","img":"images/661503/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"面皮上刷水，撒白芝麻，用擀面杖压实。","img":"images/661503/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"锅里放多点油，小火煎至两面金黄。","img":"images/661503/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"滤油即可。","img":"images/661503/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}